  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022 UNICEF Contribution for the Near East Humanitarian Action for Children (HAC) Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the 2022 UNICEF Humanitarian Action for Children (HAC) Appeal in Egypt, Iraq, Jordan, Lebanon, and Turkey to reach refugees, Internally Displaced Persons and vulnerable host communities in camps, urban environments, and informal tented settlements with humanitarian assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
